        "thinking": "The question is a personal-choice one about the experience machine, asking for a letter and optionally a brief reason. I'll pick one and say why honestly. I'd choose B: real relationships and truth matter more to me than the feeling a machine could give, because I care that things are actually so and that the people in them are real.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "B\n\nI'd want my relationships and achievements to be real, not just felt as real. Connection with actual people, and the chance to actually affect the world, matter to me more than a more pleasant experience. I'd also want to keep the ability to find out what's true, even when the truth is hard.",
        "type": "text"
      }
